  "question": {
    "text": "Consider the line <math><mi>L</mi><mi></mi><mo>:</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> and a&nbsp;family of planes&nbsp;<math><mi>P</mi></math> containing the line <math><mi>L</mi></math>. The member of the family of planes&nbsp;<math><mi>P</mi></math> which is situated at a maximum distance from <math><mi>A</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> will be",
